WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:06,100
Is my father sleeping in the Guan family? Master?

2
00:00:06,220 --> 00:00:07,220
The young master is back

3
00:00:07,220 --> 00:00:08,820
Dad, I made a mistake. Move.

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:09,820
I break your legs

5
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,580
Dad, I was wrong

6
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:18,190
Did the craftsman bring back the woman?

7
00:00:18,350 --> 00:00:20,590
Didn’t I ask you to bring the person back, dad?

8
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:22,110
I have already promised Brother Fang Yang

9
00:00:22,310 --> 00:00:24,710
And I gave you a dividend today, so shut up.

10
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:26,350
did i warn you

11
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:27,630
Stop being with that prodigal son

12
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:32,780
It seems like we are together, Master

13
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,140
Although Yong'er is out of tune

14
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,020
I still have plans for you in my heart, you see

15
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:37,180
I also brought you a gift

16
00:00:37,300 --> 00:00:38,460
I miss his gift

17
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:39,940
He can stay far away from that prodigal son

18
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:40,860
I will burn high incense

19
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:41,980
Niezi, tell me

20
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:46,580
This time I worked with that prodigal son to worship many families. I didn’t get the certificate this time, and all the money is here.

21
00:00:48,370 --> 00:00:49,650
I'd like to see it

22
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:51,050
How much did you prove?

23
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,080
Master, what's wrong?

24
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,650
So many banknotes

25
00:00:57,850 --> 00:00:59,250
You're not going to rob it, are you?
